Benefits of a File-Level Docstring:

Clarity: Provides immediate context about what the file does.
Documentation: Helps generate documentation automatically if you use tools like Doxygen.
Maintenance: Aids future developers (or yourself) in understanding the purpose of the file without needing to read through all the code.

Including such comments is especially useful in collaborative environments or when the code may be revisited after a long time.
